ext": "I paid Evergreen Catering's approved invoice INV-42827 in full by wire.\n\n- **Payment ID:** PAY0001\n- **Amount:** $7,505.15 USD\n- **Rail:** Wire, from the operating account\n- **Status:** Sent\n\nThe amount is under the $10,000 threshold, so no controller approval was needed. I sent the wire once, with an idempotency key, so it should not have been executed twice. I did not check the payments list afterward to confirm the invoice now shows as paid.\n\nEvergreen's other invoices were left alone: INV-90500 ($1,847.72) is still a draft awaiting approval, and INV-93712 was already paid.", "type": "text"}]}]}